[{"client_msg_id":"1df4d33a-242b-4d47-b5b7-b1efa94380f0","type":"message","user":"ULXMF1BC1","text":"\u003chttps://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%82%B7%E3%83%A3%E3%83%8E%E3%83%B3%EF%BC%9D%E3%83%8F%E3%83%BC%E3%83%88%E3%83%AC%E3%83%BC%E3%81%AE%E5%AE%9A%E7%90%86\u003e","ts":"1625230675.009200","attachments":[{"fallback":"wikipedia: シャノン＝ハートレーの定理","id":1,"author_name":"Wikipedia","author_link":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/","title":"シャノン＝ハートレーの定理","title_link":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%82%B7%E3%83%A3%E3%83%8E%E3%83%B3%EF%BC%9D%E3%83%8F%E3%83%BC%E3%83%88%E3%83%AC%E3%83%BC%E3%81%AE%E5%AE%9A%E7%90%86","text":"シャノン・ハートレーの定理（シャノン＝ハートレーのていり、英: Shannon–Hartley theorem）は、情報理論における定理であり、ガウスノイズを伴う理想的な連続アナログ通信路の通信路符号化を定式化したものである。この定理から、そのような通信路上で誤りなしで転送可能なデータ（すなわち情報）の最大量であるシャノンの通信路容量が求められる。このとき、ノイズの強さと信号の強さが与えられることで帯域幅が決定される。この定理の名称は、アメリカの2人の電子工学者クロード・シャノンとラルフ・ハートレーに由来している。","image_url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/23/Binaryerasurechannel.png","blocks":null,"service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/wikipedia.png","from_url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%82%B7%E3%83%A3%E3%83%8E%E3%83%B3%EF%BC%9D%E3%83%8F%E3%83%BC%E3%83%88%E3%83%AC%E3%83%BC%E3%81%AE%E5%AE%9A%E7%90%86","original_url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%82%B7%E3%83%A3%E3%83%8E%E3%83%B3%EF%BC%9D%E3%83%8F%E3%83%BC%E3%83%88%E3%83%AC%E3%83%BC%E3%81%AE%E5%AE%9A%E7%90%86"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QbFH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"317d2060-ce0c-4dd6-89c4-7e94fdb9edab","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"通信方式によるけど、通信用量を稼ごうとするとノイズ耐性が下るから補完したり補正したり高度な符号処理したりで価格が上昇する...のはよくあるような","ts":"1625227719.009000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gAh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a9ae7f48-803d-4d68-b0fc-da70a2e41631","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"通信容量低いほうがノイズ耐性あるのか…なんかしっくりこないな","ts":"1625227589.008000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"75mGC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2513afd3-945a-4f45-9d2a-a27d5780068b","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"クロックと同期しなきゃいかんか","ts":"1625199119.007300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PZkPj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"34ea7e0a-f9f7-4852-9144-8b1443ce9b37","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"速度が遅い=容量少ないほうがノイズ耐性はある気がする。","ts":"1625199096.007000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"d+wPP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6111ff47-58f5-4167-a9d1-d624177285a7","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"どういうノイズがのるかにも勿論左右されそうですが、基本的には最大通信容量に支配されそうな気がするけどなあ〜","ts":"1625196591.005900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YmDd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"901440ef-2ccd-46c0-baf7-7d5376460d71","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"ノイズについては…通信容量の差とノイズ耐性に関連あるだろうと思ってましたけど、いまググったらI2Cのほうがノイズ耐性あると書いてるブログを見かけたのでわからんくなった","ts":"1625196505.003900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"J17Lh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d0fbb4fd-a725-403f-9e19-f5045c43a08c","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"まず通信容量についてはセレクタ線で指定する（SPI）か信号始めにどのチップと通信するか含める（I2C）の違いによって根本的にSPIのほうが速いですね\nあと半二重か全二重かの違いもある","ts":"1625196410.001200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RGM+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3a76e3ef-5533-4444-941d-d1ad9b559a84","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"I2Cは複数機器が同時にオンラインになってるから、もともとノイズ乗ってて外乱耐性が低いとかかなぁ?","ts":"1625187698.497400","edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1625187764.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yXf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4abaffe1-38c8-40b5-a281-355ee7f306ec","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"んーなんでSPIのほうがノイズ対策いらないの?","ts":"1625187662.496900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9+g"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U0230SSJ32B","text":"\u003c@U0230SSJ32B\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1625184422.496200","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"9ffb196c-6111-4042-978a-6b1f5fe58fc8","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"後日ロボコンやってる友達に聞いたらI2CとSPI選べるならSPI使うに決まってんじゃんとか言われて通信容量低いんだなあということを学んだ","ts":"1625156545.496000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pm7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e8dd2df7-1fc6-4044-bb97-0dceb618667c","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"というか、全然動かなかった回路を先輩が突然通信ケーブルぶったぎって超短くしたら安定したのでノイズ対策要るねということが判明w","ts":"1625156486.495900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"H8lPo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"88ba2ba8-91b0-438f-9e48-f137d0dde2c4","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"学部の卒論のために自作回路にI2Cを使ったなあ\nその時初めて使ったけど、その回路はノイズに弱くて結局先輩がなんとかしてくれた","ts":"1625156317.495800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VEU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"88639c63-b1e5-4be3-b582-923a8e291483","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"いや草","ts":"1625156215.495700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ntDjC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9d850537-6876-4385-8414-f2bc8349d5cc","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/yuna_digick/status/1410630940372520961?s=19|https://twitter.com/yuna_digick/status/1410630940372520961?s=19\u003e","ts":"1625156201.495500","attachments":[{"fallback":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/yuna_digick|@yuna_digick\u003e: 人類はついにI2Cを光ケーブルで91m伸ばすという罪を犯してしまった。","id":1,"author_name":"ゆな でぃじっく@ニキシー管製造業","author_subname":"@yuna_digick","author_link":"https://twitter.com/yuna_digick/status/1410630940372520961","author_icon":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/536060136771420160/wmiJWGp3_normal.jpeg","text":"人類はついにI2Cを光ケーブルで91m伸ばすという罪を犯してしまった。","blocks":null,"footer":"Twitter","footer_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/services/twitter_pixel_snapped_32.png","ts":1625155599,"service_name":"twitter","from_url":"https://twitter.com/yuna_digick/status/1410630940372520961?s=19","original_url":"https://twitter.com/yuna_digick/status/1410630940372520961?s=19"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3HA2/"}]}]
